<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Feb 19.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Feb 19.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement on Wednesday. The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day (upto 0635 GMT)and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at (0635 GMT) was 3479.34, 50.89 points or 1.44 percent lower than Tuesday's close.</p>
